              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Rehobowamu, amaze gushikama ku ngoma yiwe, no kuba ūhambaye, aca areka ivyagezwe vy’Uhoraho, akwega n’ Abayuda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abayuda",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": mu Giheburayo handitswe ngw Abisirayeli, ariko n’ukuvuga ubgoko s’ukuvuga igihugu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 11:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mu mwaka ugira gatanu uwo mwami Rehobowamu ari ku ngoma, Shishaki umwami wa Egiputa adūga gutera i Yerusalemu, kuko bācumuye k’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azanana n’ imikogote y’intambara igihumbi n’amajana abiri, n’abagendera ku mafarasi ibihumbi mirongwitandatu, n’ingabo zitoharūrika zivanye na we muri Egiputa: Abalubimu n’Abasukimu n’Abanyetiyopiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.11.5+2CH.11.6+2CH.11.7+2CH.11.8+2CH.11.9+2CH.11.10+2CH.11.11+2CH.11.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 11:5-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atsinda ibisagara vy’i Buyuda bizitijwe inzitiro z’amabuye, araruha ashika n’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.11.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 11:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ uwavugishwa n’Imana Shemaya aja aho Rehobowamu n’ abaganwa b’i Buyuda bāri bakoraniye i Yerusalemu kubgo gutinya Shishaki, arababarira, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ngo Ko mwamuhevye, ngo Ni co gitumye na we abaheba akabagabura mu maboko ya Shishaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 9:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abo baganwa b’Abayuda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abayuda",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": mu Giheburayo handitswe ngw Abisirayeli, ariko n’ukuvuga ubgoko s’ukuvuga igihugu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bo n’umwami baca bicisha bugufi, baravuga, bat’ Uhoraho aragororoka, akoze ibikwiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 21:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.34.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abonye ko bicishije bugufi, ijambo ryiwe rica riza kuri Shemaya, riti Ko bicishije bugufi, sinzobarandura, ariko nzobakiza haciye akanya; kand’ uburake bganje ntibugisukwa kuri Yerusalemu bikozwe na Shishaki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
