        {
          "text": "Non’ ivyadonzwe kuri Rehobowamu vyose, uhereye ku ca mbere ugashitsa ku c’imperēra, mbega ntivyanditswe mu vyo Shemaya uwavugishwa n’Imana na Ido kamenyi bādonze, mu vyo kudondōra ba sekuruza? Kandi hāmah’ intambara hagati ya Rehobowamu na Yerobowamu na ntaryo. ",
          "type": "text",
